        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9010/254, Modern Rectangular 10 Inch Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Modern Rectangular 10 Inch Cabinet Handle comes with everything you'll need to install it on your cabinets. The contemporary shape paired with the modern finishes makes for a cabinet door pull that is very now. This high-quality pull is made out of solid brass and will be sure to stand the test of time--not just structurally, but also aesthetically. The 10 Inch Rectangular Cabinet Pull has a 12 inch overall length and a 1-3/8 inch projection.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is available in <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=omn-9010\"><b>Other Sizes</b></a>:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-rectangular-cabinet-pull-omnia-9010-102\"><b>4 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/6-inch-rectangular-cabinet-pull-omnia-9010-153\"><b>6 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/8-inch-rectangular-cabinet-pull-omnia-9010-203\"><b>8 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/12-inch-rectangular-cabinet-pull-omnia-9010-305\"><b>12 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and \r\n<a href=\"/products/18-inch-rectangular-cabinet-pull-omnia-9010-457\"><b>18 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9010 Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sold Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
